-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
JEV-9B and JEV-27B — autotrust
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The training recipe, the 24-slot decision head design and initialisation, the loss, the "bare-v1"
prompt template, the verbalizer token ids, the decision-head-as-lm_head-LoRA serving approach and the
/v1/decide API shape follow autotrust/JEV-9B and autotrust/JEV-27B (Apache 2.0):
  https://huggingface.co/autotrust/JEV-9B
  https://huggingface.co/autotrust/JEV-27B
  https://huggingface.co/autotrust/JEV-27B-VL
Evaluation protocol and client: JEV-27B-DEMO (Apache 2.0), https://github.com/yuhai-china/JEV-27B-DEMO

